WEBVTT

00:05:29.825 --> 00:05:34.580
my life basically
was an Uber to an airport,

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.332
to a hotel

00:05:36.332 --> 00:05:37.583
and back again,

00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:40.419
because I just really didn’t
want to face that.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:44.215
For a lot of us, there are things
we sometimes don’t want to face.

00:05:44.632 --> 00:05:49.095
What we’re really looking for
with work is an anesthetic.

00:05:49.804 --> 00:05:50.846
And as I like to say,

00:05:50.846 --> 00:05:53.557
work is better than crack --

00:05:53.557 --> 00:05:54.558
(Laughter)

00:05:54.558 --> 00:05:56.143
so if you’re choosing ...

00:05:56.143 --> 00:05:57.895
(Laughter)

00:05:57.895 --> 00:05:58.979
it’s not the worst.

00:05:59.188 --> 00:06:01.232
(Laughter)